    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12 [a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 12 [a]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ceorl buton wifes wisdome deoflum gelde, he sie ealra his æhtan scyldig ⁊ healsfange.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a freeman without his wife’s knowledge makes offering to devils, he shall be liable for all his possessions or healsfang.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ceorl buton wifes wisdome deoflum gelde, he sie ealra his æhtan scyldig ⁊ healsfange.</ab>
